Acting Character: Sioned ferch Cai

Sioned ferch Cai is a descendant of Kay or Cai ap Cynyr, known for her organizational skills and keeping a ledger with various debts. Her Devotion is the Table, which focuses on administration and managing resources. She stands as a mediator between her party members and their respective devotions.

In this scene, Sioned has traveled to Avalon to settle an ancient debt incurred by her ancestor. The ethereal figures at the water's edge have stated that the price for closing this account requires retrieving an artifact imbued with the power of the Fae—the heartstone of a long-extinct creature known as the Cernunnos. Sioned must navigate various challenges to obtain this item and pay her debt, all while dealing with an unknown presence following her from behind the reeds.

